## Commit Message Rules

### language

Commit messages MUST be written in Simplified Chinese (简体中文).
NEVER write the subject or body in English.
Technical terms may stay in English: SubFlow, CLIP, API, WebSocket, Docker.

### format

Use Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <中文简述>`

- type: feat | fix | refactor | docs | test | chore
- scope: module name in lowercase, optional
- 简述: explain why or what changed; do not list filenames

### examples

- feat(marketplace): 应用升级前增加 diff 预览与确认
- refactor(ui): 前端目录迁入 ui/workbench 与 ui/admin
- fix(flow): 修复 SubFlow 循环依赖导致的编译失败
